</span></span><span class="code-line"><span class="token plain-text">  </span><span class="token tag"><span class="token tag"><span class="token punctuation">&lt;</span>meshBasicMaterial</span> <span class="token punctuation">/&gt;</span></span><span class="token plain-text">
