<p class="my-4">You can also deeply nest attach through piercing. The following adds a buffer-attribute to <code class="bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono">geometry.attributes.position</code> and then adds the buffer geometry to <code class="bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono">mesh.geometry</code>.</p>
